                <form class="d-flex" role="search">
                    <input class="form-control me-2" type="search" placeholder="Search" aria-label="Search"/>
                    <button class="btn btn-outline-success" type="submit">Search</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </nav>
        <div class="row justify-content-md-center mt-3">
        <div class="col mb-3" style="max-width: 600px;">
            <div class="card">
                <img src="img/huntress.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="Huntress">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title">Huntress</h5>
                    <p class="card-text">Anna or "The Huntress" is one of 41 Killers currently featured in Dead by Daylight. The Huntress is a ranged Killer, able to throw Hunting Hatchets at Survivors to injure them from a distance. Her personal Perks, Beast of Prey, Territorial Imperative, and Hex: Huntress Lullaby, allow her to apply pressure through better map awareness and enhanced chasing abilities.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>        
    </body>
</html>